%% US-4 · Үндсэн домэйн (supabase/migrations-ээс). orders, delivery зэрэг ашиглагдаагүй хүснэгтийг оруулаагүй.
erDiagram
  CATEGORIES ||--o{ PRODUCTS : "агуулна"
  PRODUCTS |o--o{ INQUIRIES : "асуулга авна"
  USERS |o--o{ INQUIRIES : "илгээнэ (guest бол NULL)"
  USERS ||--o{ CART_ITEMS : "хадгална"
  PRODUCTS ||--o{ CART_ITEMS : "wishlist (legacy, D-14)"

  USERS {
    uuid id PK "auth.users.id"
    varchar email UK
    varchar full_name
    enum role "customer | admin | delivery_staff"
  }
  CATEGORIES {
    uuid id PK
    varchar name
    varchar slug UK
    boolean is_active
  }
  PRODUCTS {
    uuid id PK
    uuid category_id FK
    varchar name
    varchar slug UK
    numeric price
    enum status "draft | published | archived"
  }
  INQUIRIES {
    uuid id PK
    uuid product_id FK "nullable"
    uuid customer_id FK "nullable"
    varchar customer_name
    varchar phone
    enum status "new | contacted | closed"
  }
  CART_ITEMS {
    uuid id PK
    uuid user_id FK
    uuid product_id FK
    timestamptz created_at "unique(user_id, product_id)"
  }
